# Test artwork that is not ours to publish: the statue comparison derives from a
# watermarked stock photo, and the Pinocchio images are a colourised version of
# Mazzanti's 1883 illustration whose colourisation may carry its own claim.
# Useful locally for testing; not for a public repo.
docs/images/
docs/test-statue.png
docs/hero-pinocchio.png
